@startuml 
title ** DetailStatement **

actor User
participant 前台 
actor Admin
participant 後台 
participant Settle.Worker 

database    BetDetail   
database  TodoTable
database  DetailTable
participant Detail.Worker 

Group GetBetDetail
Settle.Worker-> Settle.Worker: 定期執行
Settle.Worker -> BetDetail : Insert / Update \n Settle BetRecord 
BetDetail -> TodoTable :  Insert \n TpId、TransId
Detail.Worker-> Detail.Worker: 定期執行
Detail.Worker -> TodoTable : Select \n TpId、TransId
TodoTable -> Detail.Worker : Get TpId、TransId
Detail.Worker -> TPHanlder :TpId、TransId
TPHanlder -> TPHanlder:TpId Invoke TPMethod
TPHanlder -> TPMethod:TransId
TPMethod -> ThirdPartyAPI :TransId
ThirdPartyAPI -> ThirdPartyAPI :Get Bet Detail
ThirdPartyAPI -> TPMethod : Bet Detail
TPMethod -> TPHanlder : Bet Detail
TPHanlder -> Detail.Worker : Bet Detail
Detail.Worker ->  DetailTable : Insert Bet Detail
alt Success
    Detail.Worker ->  TodoTable : Delete TpId、TransId
else Fail
    Detail.Worker ->  TodoTable : 等待下一次執行
end


END

Group 前台查詢
User -> 前台:查詢 Bet Detail
前台 -> BetDetail:TransId
BetDetail -> DetailTable:TransId
DetailTable -> BetDetail : Bet Detail
BetDetail -> 前台 : Bet Detail
END

GROUP 後台查詢
Admin -> 後台:查詢 Bet Detail
後台 -> BetDetail:TransId
BetDetail -> DetailTable:TransId
DetailTable -> BetDetail : Bet Detail
BetDetail -> 後台 : Bet Detail
END
@enduml